  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: 
    lineText: "THE BEAST OF THE EASTERN HALL\n\LNone who faced the beast returned.\LThen
      came the Hero and his companions.\LThey fought until the castle shook.\LAt
      last, the beast fell.\LAnother victory for the Hero."
